-Inspired Luxury Living","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Prime Location – Set on the edge of Dubai Water Canal in Business Bay, offering panoramic views and easy connectivity to Sheikh Zayed Road.</li><li>Ultra-Luxury Wellness Residences – Homes crafted with sustainable materials, natural finishes, and holistic design for enhanced well-being.</li><li>Renowned Developer – Created by European developer R.Evolution, known for its commitment to architectural artistry and wellness innovation.</li><li>Exclusive Amenities – Access six pools, fitness centre by Nohrd, and wellness-focused spaces like the meditation labyrinth and sound healing pyramid.</li><li>Exceptional Services – Residents enjoy Eywa Private Wellth Membership and dedicated Health &amp; Longevity Concierge services.</li><li>Global Certifications – Built to achieve WELL, LEED, and WiredScore Platinum certifications for sustainability and smart living.</li><li>Flexible Payment Plans – Only 10% down payment and a 50/50 payment plan offer ease of investment.</li><li>High Capital Appreciation – Positioned in one of Dubai’s most desirable districts, ensuring long-term value growth.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1884,"cta":{"id":2694,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":null,"isExternal":false,"custom_link":null},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_60af6d785d.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_60af6d785d","name":"Eywa 2 Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Where Urban Energy Meets Waterfront Serenity","heading":"Eywa 2 Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Situated in Business Bay and overlooking the Dubai Water Canal, Eywa 2 by R.Evolution offers the perfect balance of wellness and connectivity. Its prime position near Sheikh Zayed Road (E11) en